WEINSTEIN STRATEGY: ONE FRIDAY, STAGE BY STAGE (2024-06-28, Friday)
Account: $100,000.00 cash, portfolio value $100,000.00.
Rule values quoted under "Does:" are read from the config this run uses:
the strategy default, except where marked as a demo setting.

==== STAGE 1 of 9: INPUTS ====
  Does: rolls each ticker's daily bars up to weeks ending on Friday.
  In:   daily bars through 2024-06-28: 9 stocks, index DEMO_INDEX, 3 sector ETFs.
  Out:  the last weekly closes (oldest first), and this week's volume over the prior 4 weeks' average.

